      "end_time": 43.0,
      "text": "Waaagh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 61.9,
      "end_time": 63.1,
      "text": "Haaaaaaa!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 63.3,
      "end_time": 63.9,
      "text": "Hehe ★"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 64.3,
      "end_time": 65.0,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 65.3,
      "end_time": 66.2,
      "text": "Kya!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 71.6,
      "end_time": 73.6,
      "text": "Look away. It's not allowed."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 80.1,
      "end_time": 81.3,
      "text": "HAAAAAAHHHHHHHH!!!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 84.1,
      "end_time": 85.0,
      "text": "Hup!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 86.4,
      "end_time": 87.5,
      "text": "...!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 90.3,
      "end_time": 91.4,
      "text": "Oh my ★"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 99.9,
      "end_time": 101.6,
      "text": "I know! ★"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 103.4,
      "end_time": 104.1,
      "text": "...!?"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 104.3,
      "end_time": 105.9,
      "text": "As expected from a former terminal ♪"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 106.1,
      "end_time": 108.2,
      "text": "You're going to do what you learned, right?"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 108.5,
      "end_time": 111.1,
      "text": "R-chan, P-chan, Q-chan ★"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 111.3,
      "end_time": 113.6,
      "text": "Did she read... Their moves?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 114.0,
      "end_time": 116.4,
      "text": "Ahaha♪ I'm sorry! ★"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 119.1,
      "end_time": 120.0,
      "text": "?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 120.3,
      "end_time": 124.5,
      "text": "R-chan and the others techniques they got when they were terminals..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 125.0,
      "end_time": 127.7,
      "text": "You see, I'm on the administrator's side★"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 127.8,
      "end_time": 128.7,
      "text": "No way..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 128.9,
      "end_time": 132.4,
      "text": "Then... do Miss Riri and the others stand a chance...?"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 133.4,
      "end_time": 136.6,
      "text": "*pant pant*..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 138.5,
      "end_time": 141.9,
      "text": "Hmm... It seems like we've hit a dead end, huh?"
